chimes":[]}},"sentences":[{"role":"hook","text":"If you bolt a chain straight to a spinning engine, you have a chainsaw."},{"role":"problem","text":"But the chain never stops, so at idle it keeps whipping round and grabs your leg."},{"role":"fix1","text":"So you put two heavy shoes on the shaft, held in by a spring, inside a drum."},{"role":"how","text":"Rev the engine, and the shoes fly outward, grab the drum, and the chain runs."},{"role":"name","text":"This is a centrifugal clutch."},{"role":"congrats","text":"Congratulations, you have built a chainsaw clutch."}]}